00:22:26.130 --> 00:22:31.230
got to drive to location, and I wrote that you and I carpooled, and we had the best time.

522
00:22:31.290 --> 00:22:36.990
I wrote, I was like, we chatted, we sang songs, and you know, we solved the world's probleMs.

523
00:22:37.110 --> 00:22:37.830
That's what I wrote.

