00:22:37.990 --> 00:22:39.230
I do not remember that.

525
00:22:39.730 --> 00:22:42.870
I don't remember it either, but we clearly had a great time.

526
00:22:43.010 --> 00:22:47.070
I love that you wrote that down because I'm sure we did do that because we lived really

527
00:22:47.070 --> 00:22:47.430
close.

528
00:22:47.670 --> 00:22:50.890
We lived really close, and we were probably so excited that we had to commute.

529
00:22:51.350 --> 00:22:51.550
Yeah.

530
00:22:51.890 --> 00:22:56.050
We had to drive far, and I said it was a little bit of a drive, but the thing that really

