00:23:04.450 --> 00:23:05.110
I'd love to know.

536
00:23:05.210 --> 00:23:06.070
I wish I knew.

537
00:23:06.430 --> 00:23:07.150
Sounds of Scranton.

538
00:23:07.410 --> 00:23:09.510
Oh, I hope we sang Sounds of Scranton.

539
00:23:09.670 --> 00:23:10.070
All right.

540
00:23:10.210 --> 00:23:12.050
So let's get into this episode now.

