00:23:20.030 --> 00:23:21.290
And Michael looks out his window.

546
00:23:21.450 --> 00:23:22.110
He sees him coming.

547
00:23:22.110 --> 00:23:28.230
He panics because probably Michael has some growing in maturity to do about how he perceives

548
00:23:28.230 --> 00:23:28.590
others.

