1455
00:59:51.700 --> 00:59:52.280
It's true.

1456
00:59:52.420 --> 00:59:53.480
As a cast member.

1457
00:59:53.560 --> 00:59:54.080
I'm so sorry.

1458
00:59:54.260 --> 00:59:59.080
When we would see that there was a big pivotal Jim and Pam scene, we'd be like, oh God, are

1459
00:59:59.080 --> 01:00:00.300
you before it or after it?

1460
01:00:00.540 --> 01:00:00.920
Oh no.

1461
01:00:01.240 --> 01:00:04.440
I feel like Phyllis would bring in all of her bills to pay.

