1470
01:00:19.880 --> 01:00:21.040
I have a three-hour break.

1471
01:00:21.240 --> 01:00:25.020
Well, just know that it was always so important to us to get it right.

1472
01:00:25.180 --> 01:00:28.860
And I remember having long conversations about this scene.

1473
01:00:28.860 --> 01:00:33.720
So the words that are written in this scene are of no importance.

1474
01:00:34.800 --> 01:00:40.840
We discussed that what was important was everything we're not saying, the subtext of the scene.

1475
01:00:40.840 --> 01:00:47.200
This is all about Pam being in Jim's bedroom and sitting on his bed.

1476
01:00:47.420 --> 01:00:52.660
We had to make sure that we very naturally found a way for Pam to sit on his bed.

1477
01:00:52.740 --> 01:00:54.760
And she couldn't just walk in the room and sit on the bed.

1478
01:00:55.300 --> 01:00:58.540
So she had to start by sitting on his night table.

1479
01:00:58.540 --> 01:01:05.260
And then we had to put the yearbook in exactly the right place so that when she went to grab

1480
01:01:05.260 --> 01:01:08.640
it, she would most naturally then sit on his bed.

1481
01:01:10.260 --> 01:01:19.200
And as I was watching this, it brought me back to all of those moments early on in dating

1482
01:01:19.200 --> 01:01:25.860
and in college or whatever, when you walk into that person's bedroom for the first time.

1483
01:01:26.080 --> 01:01:28.060
And you've thought about it for a long time.

1484
01:01:28.240 --> 01:01:30.440
You've thought about it like, where do they sleep?

1485
01:01:30.680 --> 01:01:32.240
What does that look like?

1486
01:01:32.420 --> 01:01:35.220
This is their most intimate room in their house.

1487
01:01:37.460 --> 01:01:39.820
And John is so perfect.

1488
01:01:40.040 --> 01:01:46.440
If you notice, as soon as Pam sits down on the bed, John starts shifting in his desk chair.

1489
01:01:46.440 --> 01:01:49.320
And he looks at her and he immediately looks away.

1490
01:01:49.520 --> 01:01:55.460
Like the fact that she's just sat on his bed, it's almost too much for him.

1491
01:01:56.060 --> 01:02:03.760
Not only is this woman he's in love with in his room, but now she is in this intimate place

1492
01:02:03.760 --> 01:02:09.060
where she's sitting across from him on his bed as he's probably hoped and thought about

1493
01:02:09.060 --> 01:02:10.820
for a long, long time.

1494
01:02:11.160 --> 01:02:13.260
And here's what I love about our show.

1495
01:02:13.260 --> 01:02:18.760
And I think that this is why people are in love with Jim and Pam and why they respond to

